second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Muammer Koç attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 92, \"text\": \"Title: The Academic Odyssey of Muammer Koç: Unraveling the Threads of a Researcher's Journey\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 94, \"end\": 251, \"text\": \"In the realm of academia, where the pursuit of knowledge is a lifelong endeavor, researchers like Muammer Koç leave an indelible mark on their chosen fields.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 252, \"end\": 393, \"text\": \"As we delve into the narrative of Koç's academic journey, a fascinating tale of dedication, perseverance, and intellectual curiosity unfolds.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 394, \"end\": 551, \"text\": \"At the heart of this story lies a pivotal chapter: Koç's attendance at Ohio State University, a public research institution in Columbus, Ohio, United States.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 552, \"end\": 733, \"text\": \"The threads of evidence that weave together to support this claim begin with Koç's ORCID profile, a digital identifier that serves as a unique fingerprint for researchers worldwide.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 734, \"end\": 918, \"text\": \"The profile, bearing the identifier 0000-0001-6543-8116, provides a window into Koç's academic trajectory, showcasing a rich tapestry of publications, collaborations, and affiliations.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 919, \"end\": 995, \"text\": \"Among these affiliations, one institution stands out: Ohio State University.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 996, \"end\": 1132, \"text\": \"A closer examination of Koç's research output reveals a pattern of publications that intersect with the university's academic landscape.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1133, \"end\": 1375, \"text\": \"A 2018 paper titled \\\"Investigating the Role of MicroRNAs in Cancer Stem Cell Maintenance\\\" lists Koç as a co-author, with an affiliation to the Department of Biological Chemistry and Pharmacology at Ohio State University's College of Medicine.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1376, \"end\": 1533, \"text\": \"This publication serves as a tangible link between Koç and the university, demonstrating his involvement in cutting-edge research projects during his tenure.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1534, \"end\": 1654, \"text\": \"Further evidence emerges from Koç's participation in academic conferences and workshops hosted by Ohio State University.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1655, \"end\": 1860, \"text\": \"A 2015 conference program for the university's annual Biomedical Engineering Symposium features Koç as a presenter, discussing his research on \\\"MicroRNA-Mediated Regulation of Cancer Stem Cell Properties.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1861, \"end\": 2003, \"text\": \"This presentation not only underscores Koç's expertise in his field but also solidifies his connection to the university's academic community.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2004, \"end\": 2139, \"text\": \"In addition to these academic pursuits, Koç's online presence provides further insight into his association with Ohio State University.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2140, \"end\": 2320, \"text\": \"A LinkedIn profile, maintained by Koç, lists Ohio State University as one of his educational institutions, with a corresponding time frame that aligns with his research activities.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2321, \"end\": 2451, \"text\": \"This digital footprint serves as a testament to Koç's commitment to transparency and accuracy in his professional online presence.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2452, \"end\": 2606, \"text\": \"As we navigate the narrative of Muammer Koç's academic journey, the cumulative evidence paints a vivid picture of his attendance at Ohio State University.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 86, \"text\": \"**Renowned Researcher Muammer Koç Reflects on Formative Years at Zhejiang University**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 88, \"end\": 311, \"text\": \"Hangzhou, China - In an exclusive interview, esteemed researcher Muammer Koç, known for his groundbreaking work in various fields, opened up about the pivotal role Zhejiang University played in shaping his academic journey.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 312, \"end\": 492, \"text\": \"Koç, whose impressive ORCID profile boasts an impressive 0000-0001-6543-8116 identifier, credits his time at Zhejiang University for laying the foundation of his remarkable career.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 493, \"end\": 573, \"text\": \"\\\"My experience at Zhejiang University was truly transformative,\\\" Koç reminisced.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 574, \"end\": 740, \"text\": \"\\\"The university's emphasis on interdisciplinary research and collaboration instilled in me a passion for exploring the unknown, which has driven my work to this day.\\\"\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 741, \"end\": 878, \"text\": \"During his tenure at the prestigious institution, Koç was part of a vibrant academic community that encouraged innovation and creativity.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 879, \"end\": 1043, \"text\": \"\\\"The faculty at Zhejiang University were not only exceptional mentors but also role models who inspired us to push the boundaries of human knowledge,\\\" Koç recalled.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1044, \"end\": 1244, \"text\": \"Data from Zhejiang University's alumni office reveals that Koç's class had an impressive 95% placement rate, with many graduates going on to pursue advanced degrees at top-tier institutions worldwide.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1245, \"end\": 1337, \"text\": \"Koç's own trajectory is a testament to the university's success in nurturing talented minds.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1338, \"end\": 1471, \"text\": \"Since graduating, he has published numerous papers in esteemed journals, earning him recognition as a leading authority in his field.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1472, \"end\": 1604, \"text\": \"When asked about the most significant takeaway from his time at Zhejiang University, Koç emphasized the importance of collaboration.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1605, \"end\": 1815, \"text\": \"\\\"The university's strong industry connections and research partnerships provided us with opportunities to work on real-world problems, fostering a sense of responsibility and purpose in our work,\\\" he explained.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1816, \"end\": 1968, \"text\": \"Zhejiang University's President, Professor Wang, praised Koç's achievements, stating, \\\"We are proud to count Muammer Koç among our distinguished alumni.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1969, \"end\": 2143, \"text\": \"His remarkable career is a testament to the university's commitment to excellence and our mission to cultivate innovative thinkers who can make a positive impact on society.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Muammer Koç\", \"scope\": \"educational institution attended\", \"claim\": \"Muammer Koç attended Ohio State University.\", \"answer\": \"Ohio State University\", \"quote\": \"At the heart of this story lies a pivotal chapter: Koç's attendance at Ohio State University, a public research institution in Columbus, Ohio, United States. The threads of evidence that weave together to support this claim begin with Koç's ORCID profile, a digital identifier that serves as a unique fingerprint for researchers worldwide. The profile, bearing the identifier 0000-0001-6543-8116, provides a window into Koç's academic trajectory, showcasing a rich tapestry of publications, collaborations, and affiliations. Among these affiliations, one institution stands out: Ohio State University. A closer examination of Koç's research output reveals a pattern of publications that intersect with the university's academic landscape. A 2018 paper titled \\\"Investigating the Role of MicroRNAs in Cancer Stem Cell Maintenance\\\" lists Koç as a co-author, with an affiliation to the Department of Biological Chemistry and Pharmacology at Ohio State University's College of Medicine. This publication serves as a tangible link between Koç and the university, demonstrating his involvement in cutting-edge research projects during his tenure. Further evidence emerges from Koç's participation in academic conferences and workshops hosted by Ohio State University. A 2015 conference program for the university's annual Biomedical Engineering Symposium features Koç as a presenter, discussing his research on \\\"MicroRNA-Mediated Regulation of Cancer Stem Cell Properties.\\\" This presentation not only underscores Koç's expertise in his field but also solidifies his connection to the university's academic community. In addition to these academic pursuits, Koç's online presence provides further insight into his association with Ohio State University. A LinkedIn profile, maintained by Koç, lists Ohio State University as one of his educational institutions, with a corresponding time frame that aligns with his research activities.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Ohio State University\", \"Zhejiang University\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Ohio State University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Zhejiang University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
